WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.440
This is our power to open the future!

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:12.740
Synchro Summoning and Accel Synchro 
destroyed your plans and phony future!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.990
Oh really?  I think you're 
approaching your destiny.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.730
Thanks to you, my field is a burnt field.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:29.330
But don't worry.  We...  I mean-

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.370
Aporia...

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:31.650
...will fix destiny!

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.120
Aporia?

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:38.820
Now is the time for three souls 
born from despair to become one!

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.610
Took you long enough, Jose.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:54.500
It's time for me to battle Yusei Fudo again.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.230
Me too!

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.370
What's happening?

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:32.860
My name is Aporia.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.220
What's this?

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.390
What's going on?

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:38.680
He's not human?

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:40.820
What's going on?

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:42.900
The three combined.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.630
What?

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:47.570
No way!

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:49.380
Impossible!

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:50.540
What's going on?

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:54.250
The duelists and the D-Wheels combined?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.650
What's going on?

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.230
That's not possible!

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:02.330
Who or what are you?

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.360
My name is Aporia, the guardian of despair.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:10.830
Aporia?

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.630
We three were formerly one.

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.820
This is my true form.

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:21.140
Yusei Fudo, you truly are a great duelist.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:24.070
You destroyed Meklord, just as I wanted.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:24.880
What?

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.490
Now the Circuit is closer to completion.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.180
What are you talking about?

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:33.720
My turn!

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:37.980
Due to the Continuous Trap 
Infinite Prison's effect...

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:43.890
I discard one card to take Grand Core from my 
graveyard and set it in my Spell & Trap Card Zone.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.000
I activate Infinite Prison's second effect.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:53.550
By sending it to the graveyard, cards set by 
Infinite Prison's effect return to my hand.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:00.920
The three despairs call forth 
the newest and mightiest power.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.750
I activate my trap Mekord Emperor Creation.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:08.650
I send Sky Core, Wise Core and Grand 
Core from my hand to the graveyard.

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:16.330
I Special Summon Meklord Astro Mekanikle!

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.820
Meklord Astro Mekanikle?

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.690
The mightiest power...

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.360
Meklord Astro Mekanikle.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:44.220
This is their final trump card.

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:18.350
Run away!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.520
Help me!

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.710
What's going on?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.400
Is it a natural disaster?  
Is it the end of the world?

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:30.030
Lightning is suddenly striking the stadium!

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:33.310
It's too dangerous to stay here!

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.200
We're evacuating!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.750
Hey, wait!

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.710
Wait a second!

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:44.090
Stop the train!

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.920
What's going on?

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:54.070
This happened before!

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:56.170
This is bad.

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:03.970
Director Yeager, please stop the duel!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.620
That's impossible.

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:10.670
Just like with Ghost, I 
can't stop it mid-duel!

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.400
That means...

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:16.850
We have to pray that they'll succeed.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.290
You must win!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.560
Team 5D's!

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.410
Yusei Fudo!

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.190
Riding Duels.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:31.320
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:38.190
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:45.950
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:50.320
Is a new legendary duel

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:07.440
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:13.040
Set free your infinite potential

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:18.480
Every beginning is up to you

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:24.990
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:30.360
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:36.200
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:43.980
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:49.350
Even if you can't see your destination

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:54.890
Run on your feet without fear

00:07:55.120 --> 00:08:00.430
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:07.470
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:27.450
Demon of Despair!
Meklord Astro Mekanikle

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.530
Meklord Astro Mekanikle.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.190
It looks powerful.

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:39.160
But Yusei is still in the duel!

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:44.400
Yeah.  As long as he has Shooting Star 
Dragon's power, he can avoid his attack!

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:49.120
Witness the power of Meklord Astro 
Mekanikle, the demon of despair!

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:55.740
Once per turn, it can absorb a Synchro 
Monster and gain its attack points!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.330
I activate Shooting Star Dragon's effect!

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:03.790
Once during your turn, I 
can remove it from play!

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:05.210
That's pointless.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.830
Meklord Astro Mekanikle's 
effect lets me send a Meklord

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.490
Emperor part from my hand to the 
graveyard to gain its effect.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:16.770
I send Granel Guard 3 to my 
graveyard and activate its effect.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:21.940
Once per turn, your monster's 
effect is negated!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:25.840
What?

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:27.400
You must be kidding!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:30.580
Shooting Star Dragon's effect was negated!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.410
Shooting Star Dragon!

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:48.980
Unbelievable!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:55.570
Meklord Astro Mekanikle absorbed Yusei 
Fudo's trump card Shooting Star Dragon!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:58.980
And the broadcast staff left!

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:07.380
Hurry up!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:08.680
Help me!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:14.340
But neither Yusei Fudo nor I will give up!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:19.170
Even if lightning fries me, 
I'll keep broadcasting!

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:22.400
Yusei, what are you going to do?  
At this rate, you can't win!

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:23.980
There's nothing he can do!

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:25.940
Yusei...

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:30.650
Meklord Astro Mekanikle.

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:34.510
This is the door to despair.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:38.910
Yusei Fudo, you'll experience 
the same despair that I did.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:45.560
In order to fight against despair, I divided 
myself into three and came to this era.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.250
What do you mean?

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:51.320
I'll tell you why I separated 
myself into Jose,

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:55.460
Lucciano and Placido and became 
the three Iliaster emperors.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.220
What?

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:06.270
This world again?

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:10.900
What's that dome?

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:14.750
Where are we?

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:16.040
Someone's there.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.600
Why did this happen?

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.430
Jose?  No, it's Aporia.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.710
Anyone...

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:43.930
After witnessing the end of mankind and 
history, I trembled in despair as the only survivor.

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:49.350
However, I wasn't the only survivor.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:02.270
We are the last survivors of this world.

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:05.980
As survivors, we must carry out our mission.

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:25.970
Moment's negative power 
destroyed the world, so

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:31.060
our mission was to bring 
back hope for the future.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:35.180
The four of us used our 
remaining strength to find

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:39.510
a way to resurrect mankind 
and this destroyed world.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:45.770
But all our effort was in vain.

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:56.340
We spent endless hours, 
and two of us passed away.

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:05.910
Aporia...

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.800
There's no future here.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.970
You're going to leave me by myself?

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:15.800
Listen to me, Z-one.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:20.440
My heart is made of three despairs.

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:22.690
Three despairs?

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.150
That's right.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:36.090
Despair for losing people who loved me.

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:47.920
Despair for losing someone to love.

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:55.600
Despair for not needing love.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:08.090
Z-one, use this power to split my heart into 
three despairs and use them as your minions.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:10.300
Aporia...

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:16.350
You must regain hope for the future.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:20.370
I promise, Aporia.

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:39.430
Lucciano, Placido and Jose resurrected 
as three despairs and created Iliaster.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:45.400
I'll fulfill the final promise I made with my 
friends and stop the future from being destroyed!

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:50.340
To do that, I must erase Neo Domino 
City from the historical timeline.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.560
Erase Neo Domino City from 
the historical timeline?

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:59.530
That's right.  Our plan is to destroy the 
beginning of Moment and save the future.

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.520
What?

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:05.700
When Team New World wins, Neo 
Domino City will be destroyed.

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:08.180
And the future will change!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:09.650
Stop joking!

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:12.080
We have once again become one.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:17.670
Since the three despairs are now one, 
you cannot defeat my overwhelming power.

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:23.040
Witness the power of hate 
created from despair!

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:33.950
What?

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:03.560
They've left the course and are 
dueling on the public roads!

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:06.830
Citizens, be careful!

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.590
Hurry up and do something, Yusei Fudo!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.540
The city will be in chaos!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:24.970
In order to stop the Ark Cradle's 
arrival, I must win this duel!

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:33.180
Since I absorbed Shooting Star 
Dragon, you have no hope.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:38.350
Only dark despair awaits you, Yusei Fudo!

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:41.470
This is bad.

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:44.490
We're getting bystanders 
involved in our fight.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:45.780
What should I do?

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:49.240
Meklord Astro Mekanikle attacks you directly.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.650
The Cube of Despair!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.400
Mama!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:57.860
Mama!

00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:58.830
Oh no!

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:01.290
I activate the trap Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:04.770
It negates your monster's attack!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:07.830
Run away!

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:17.710
I'll lead him to the old BAD Area 
because there's less people there!

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.400
Follow me!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:33.980
The battlefield is switching 
to the old BAD Area!

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:43.580
This should be far enough.

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.280
How pointless.

00:17:45.820 --> 00:17:47.870
I set one card.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:52.440
Meklord Astro Mekanikle's effect 
activates during the End Phase.

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:56.040
By sending an absorbed Synchro 
Monster to the graveyard, you

00:17:56.040 --> 00:18:00.850
take damage equal to that Synchro 
Monster's original attack points.

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:08.450
This is bad!  Shooting Star Dragon's 
original attack points are 3300!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.960
Yusei has 2800 life points!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:14.450
If Yusei takes this damage, he loses!

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.400
I activate the trap Wild Tornado!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:22.940
I destroy one faceup card in 
the Spell & Trap Card Zone!

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.380
I destroy Shooting Star Dragon!

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:36.340
What?

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.540
Shooting Star Dragon?

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:41.140
He had to destroy it?

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:45.220
But it negated Meklord Astro 
Mekanikle's damage effect.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:47.690
I end my turn.

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.280
My turn!

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.110
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:02.060
By removing 7 Speed 
Counters, I draw one card!

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:05.520
I summon Salvagent in attack position!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.450
I can release this card to negate 
the effects of a Synchro

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:18.730
Monster in my graveyard and Special 
Summon it in defense position!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:29.620
But the monster summoned by this effect 
doesn't count as a Synchro Monster!

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:32.330
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:37.240
You got rid of its Synchro 
Monster status and its effects.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:41.010
It can no longer be absorbed, but...

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:44.710
Shooting Star Dragon turned 
into an ordinary monster.

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:46.720
What are you planning to do, Yusei?

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:53.800
When I win this duel, 
there will be destruction.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:58.870
That destruction will open 
the door to a new future.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:02.080
There won't be a new 
future after destruction!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.840
I'll prove it.

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:08.040
Iliaster created that history!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.360
My turn!

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:15.420
I activate Speed World 2's effect.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:21.090
By removing 7 Speed Counters, 
I draw one card from my deck.

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:26.350
By sending a Meklord Emperor 
part from my hand to the

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:29.820
graveyard, Meklord Astro Mekanikle 
gains that monster's effect.

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:33.120
Mekanikle gains Wisel Attack 5's effect.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:39.800
When it attacks a monster in defense 
position, you take double the piercing damage!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.250
But I have Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:50.220
It's pointless.  When Wisel Attack 5 
attacks, it negates and destroys your trap card.

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:51.190
What?

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:55.680
Oh no!  He can't use Scrap-Iron 
Scarecrow to stop the attack!

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:57.120
That's not all.

00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:00.250
Shooting Star Dragon has 2500 defense points.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.140
Meklord Astro Mekanikle 
has 4000 attack points.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:07.910
The difference is 1500 points, so Yusei will 
take double for 3000 points of piercing damage.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:12.140
Yusei has 2800 life points.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:15.120
Don't get up, Jack!

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:18.580
If this attack succeeds, Yusei wil lose!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:24.290
Neo Domino City and the 
world will be destroyed!

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:35.780
Well, Yusei Fudo?

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:37.880
How does despair taste?

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.880
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:10.980 --> 00:22:16.210
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:21.590
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:24.320
Our hearts resonate

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:29.560
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.690 --> 00:22:36.200
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.970
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:42.970 --> 00:22:48.010
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:54.190
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:54.190 --> 00:23:02.760
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:08.370
We will draw it forever
